---
layout: false
permalink: /
heroCta: true        # the hero owns the orange Follow button; base.njk adds the nav handoff
railCta: outline     # ...so the rail's copy is an outline on this page
bioStrip: false      # the hero's curator line does the strip's job here
heroRing: true       # the 3D ring in the hero (desktop only); base.njk loads its script
---
{% extends "base.njk" %}

{% block jsonld %}
<script type="application/ld+json">{{ hub | schemaHome | jsonld | safe }}</script>
{% endblock %}

{% block hero %}
{#- Hero: The Index (search + topics + New in ticker) with the curator line.
    Chosen Nov 21, 2026 from three prototypes; see CLAUDE.md §8. -#}
<header class="hero hero--home">
  <canvas class="topo-canvas" data-topo-motion aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  <div class="topo-overlay"></div>
  {#- The ring: a hologram that spins like a ring on a table (dn-ring-shader.js).
      Ambient art, like the topo; desktop only, nothing loads below 1100px. -#}
  <div class="hero__ring" data-hero-ring data-model="/assets/models/one-ring.glb" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="wrap hero__inner">
    <span class="eyebrow a-fade">Free &middot; {{ hub.resources.length }} resources &middot; Added to as I find them</span>
    <h1 class="hero-title"><span class="ln"><span>One Hub to</span></span> <span class="ln"><span>Rule Them All</span></span></h1>
    <p class="lede a-rise a-d1">A collection of resources from around the interwebs for UX builders, designers, specialists and tinkerers. Like a cat bringing a dead bird to your bed: less mess, same sentiment.</p>

    <div class="curator a-rise a-d2">
      <img class="curator__img" src="/assets/img/dan-avatar.jpg" alt="" width="44" height="44">
      <p class="curator__who"><b>Curated by {{ site.person.name }}</b><span>Design Leader &middot; AI Builder &middot; Org Fixer</span></p>
      <a class="btn-cta curator__cta" data-hero-cta href="{{ site.person.linkedin }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Follow on LinkedIn <span class="arrow arrow--out" aria-hidden="true">&nearr;</span><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>
    </div>

    {#- Phones: the nav has no room for search, so it sits here -#}
    {% set sid = "hero" %}{% set searchClass = "search--hero a-rise a-d3" %}{% include "search.njk" %}

    <nav class="topic-chips" aria-label="Browse by topic">
      {%- for t in hub.topics %}
      <a class="topic-chip t-{{ t.key }}" href="/topics/{{ t.key }}/" data-tag="{{ t.key }}" title="{{ t.desc }}">
        <span class="topic-chip__icon">{{ (hub.tags[t.key].icon or "tag") | icon | safe }}</span>{{ t.label }}<span class="topic-chip__n">{{ t.resources.length }}</span>
      </a>
      {%- endfor %}
    </nav>
  </div>

  {#- New in: every resource, newest first, drifting slowly. Pauses on hover
      and keyboard focus, and with the button; static with reduced motion. -#}
  <div class="ticker" data-ticker>
    <span class="ticker__label"><span class="ticker__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>New in</span>
    <div class="ticker__viewport">
      <div class="ticker__track">
        {%- for pass in [1, 2] %}
        <ul class="ticker__list"{% if pass == 2 %} aria-hidden="true"{% endif %}>
          {%- for r in hub.resources %}
          <li><a class="tick t-{{ r.tags[0] }}" href="/r/{{ r.id }}/"{% if pass == 2 %} tabindex="-1"{% endif %}><span class="tick__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>{{ r.title | shortTitle }}</a></li>
          {%- endfor %}
        </ul>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
    <button class="ticker__toggle" type="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Pause the New in ticker">
      <span class="ticker__pause">{{ "pause" | icon | safe }}</span><span class="ticker__play">{{ "play" | icon | safe }}</span>
    </button>
  </div>
</header>
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
    <section class="section section--flush" id="featured">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">Featured</span>
        <h2>Top of mind right now.</h2>
        <p>A handful of resources, swapped in and out as what's useful changes. Everything else is in the <a href="#archive" class="text-link">archive</a> below.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="artifact-grid pinned-grid" id="pinned-grid">
        {%- set sizes = "(min-width: 1100px) 260px, (min-width: 780px) 320px, 100vw" %}
        {%- for a in hub.pinned %}
        {% include "card.njk" %}
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="archive">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">The archive</span>
        <h2>Everything kept, organized and filterable.</h2>
        <p>Every link, download, explainer and video in one place. Filter by topic; every filtered view is a link you can share.</p>
      </div>

      {#- One filter row: the topics, in their colours. Every card already
          shows its format, so format filtering was dropped (Nov 21, 2026). -#}
      <div class="filters archive-bar">
        <div class="filter-group" role="group" aria-label="Filter by topic">
          <button class="topic-chip topic-chip--filter is-active" type="button" data-filter-tag="all" aria-pressed="true">All<span class="topic-chip__n">{{ hub.resources.length }}</span></button>
          {%- for t in hub.topics %}
          <button class="topic-chip topic-chip--filter t-{{ t.key }}" type="button" data-filter-tag="{{ t.key }}" aria-pressed="false"><span class="topic-chip__icon">{{ (hub.tags[t.key].icon or "tag") | icon | safe }}</span>{{ t.label }}<span class="topic-chip__n">{{ t.resources.length }}</span></button>
          {%- endfor %}
        </div>
        <p class="results-line">Showing <span id="results-count">{{ hub.resources.length }}</span> of <span id="resources-total">{{ hub.resources.length }}</span></p>
      </div>

      <p class="sr-only" role="status" id="results-status"></p>
      {%- set sizes = "" %}
      <div class="artifact-grid" id="resources-grid">
        {%- for a in hub.resources %}
        {% include "card.njk" %}
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>

      <div class="empty-state" id="resources-empty" hidden>
        <span class="eyebrow">No matches</span>
        <p>Nothing in this topic yet. Try another one.</p>
        <button class="chip" type="button" id="clear-filters">Clear filters</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section--flush" id="about">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">About Dan</span>
        <h2>Human-centered. Always.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="bio-layout">
        <div class="bio-photo-wrap">
          <img src="/assets/img/dan-headshot.jpg" alt="Dan Nemirovsky" class="bio-photo" width="474" height="512" loading="lazy">
        </div>
        <div class="bio-content">
          <p>I'm a designer, strategist, and product thinker with 20+ years building teams and products across finance, healthcare, tech, big data, and automotive — in startups, in corporate environments, and on my own. Products I shipped at Prudential Financial and Northwell Health are still running, and still winning awards.</p>
          <p>My approach is human-centered and data-informed: design that gets tested, iterated, tested again, and still keeps a spark of soul. I'm most useful when the problem is messy — merging design and engineering cultures, modernizing legacy systems, or helping a team remember what it feels like to make something people love.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h3 class="subhead">Tools I reach for</h3>
      <div class="pill-row pill-row--flush">
        <span class="pill">Figma</span>
        <span class="pill">Design Systems</span>
        <span class="pill">Motion Design</span>
        <span class="pill">Accessibility</span>
        <span class="pill">Claude</span>
        <span class="pill">Gemini</span>
        <span class="pill">Codex</span>
        <span class="pill">Prompt Engineering</span>
        <span class="pill">HTML / CSS / JS</span>
        <span class="pill">Fractional CDO / UX</span>
      </div>

      <h3 class="subhead">Outside the work</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-3">
        <div class="format-card">
          <span class="fico">{{ "coffee" | icon | safe }}</span>
          <h3>Coffee. Obviously.</h3>
          <p>Every good idea starts with a cup. Every great idea starts with two.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="format-card">
          <span class="fico">{{ "camera" | icon | safe }}</span>
          <h3>Photography &amp; Video</h3>
          <p>If it can be framed, I'm already thinking about the shot — documentary-style, natural light, no exceptions.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="format-card">
          <span class="fico">{{ "mountain" | icon | safe }}</span>
          <h3>Hudson Valley Explorer</h3>
          <p>Trails, farms, small towns, mountain views. It keeps showing up in the work. Hard not to be inspired.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="format-card">
          <span class="fico">{{ "type" | icon | safe }}</span>
          <h3>Obsessive Type Nerd</h3>
          <p>Yes, I notice bad kerning in restaurant menus. No, I cannot be stopped.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="format-card">
          <span class="fico">{{ "spark" | icon | safe }}</span>
          <h3>AI-Augmented, Not AI-Dependent</h3>
          <p>Integrated into every stage of the workflow. The strategy, craft, and decisions are still human — the speed isn't.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="format-card">
          <span class="fico">{{ "target" | icon | safe }}</span>
          <h3>Still Excited After 20 Years</h3>
          <p>The problems keep changing. The satisfaction of solving them hasn't. That's the whole reason to keep doing this.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
{% endblock %}
